author's code n=16: 6000 growths; mean K 3.1602 vs exact 3.1576 (z = +0.29); sd 0.7014 vs exact 0.6942 (variance z = +1.15, lower-tail p = 0.8752); chi2 fit 3.3 on 4 dof, p = 0.5162
author's code n=25: 6000 growths; mean K 4.6743 vs exact 4.6716 (z = +0.27); sd 0.7891 vs exact 0.7904 (variance z = -0.18, lower-tail p = 0.4284); chi2 fit 1.6 on 5 dof, p = 0.9039
author's code n=50: 6000 growths; mean K 8.6942 vs exact 8.7021 (z = -0.63); sd 0.9873 vs exact 0.9745 (variance z = +1.43, lower-tail p = 0.9237); chi2 fit 10.1 on 5 dof, p = 0.0738
author's code n=100: 6000 growths; mean K 16.4802 vs exact 16.4921 (z = -0.77); sd 1.2256 vs exact 1.2094 (variance z = +1.46, lower-tail p = 0.9280); chi2 fit 6.1 on 8 dof, p = 0.6409
